# 统一换行符,避免 Windows / Linux 协作者之间产生无意义的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 让 git 正确识别语言、统计与 diff
*.cs      text diff=csharp
*.asmdef  text
*.json    text
*.md      text

# 二进制资源不做换行符转换
*.png          binary
*.jpg          binary
*.jpeg         binary
*.tga          binary
*.psd          binary
*.tif          binary
*.exr          binary
*.fbx          binary
*.obj          binary
*.blend        binary
*.dll          binary
*.zip          binary
*.unitypackage binary
*.asset        binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# git archive 导出规则(VPM 发布 zip 用)
# 带 export-ignore 的路径不会进入 `git archive` 产出的压缩包,
# 因此发布包里只有 Unity 包本体,不含仓库 / CI 相关文件。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.github/        export-ignore
VpmListing/     export-ignore
.gitignore      export-ignore
.gitattributes  export-ignore
